# Docker build context is the repo root (ld-service needs its sibling modules and the parent pom).
# Keep generated output, VCS metadata and -- importantly -- run artifacts out of the image: the
# *.log / *.csv / *.xlsx / summary.xml files below are written to the working directory by every
# run and can contain real sample data. Mirrors the run-artifact entries in .gitignore.
.git
.claude
.idea
.settings
.DS_Store
**/target

/immuno.log*
/*/immuno.log*
/linkages.log
/linkageWarnings.log
/nonCwdWarnings.log
/haplotypePairs.log
/haplotypePairWarnings.log
/detectedFindings.csv
/detectedFindings.xlsx
/summary.xml
/*/linkages.log
/*/linkageWarnings.log
/*/nonCwdWarnings.log
/*/haplotypePairs.log
/*/haplotypePairWarnings.log
/*/detectedFindings.csv
/*/detectedFindings.xlsx
/*/summary.xml
